=== dequoting-backslash-word-breaks
--- script
file_write "with space.txt" ""
set rl_completer_quote_characters "\""
set rl_completer_word_break_characters " \t"
set rl_filename_quote_characters " "
set rl_filename_dequoting_function log
set rl_char_is_quoted_p backslash
readline "> "
--- keys
x with\\ sp\t<dump>\r
